---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const withBase = (path = '') => `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/${path.replace(/^\//, '')}`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Degin Studios"
  description="Privacy Policy for Infini Jumper by Degin Studios."
>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <a class="back-link" href={withBase()}>Back to Degin Studios</a>
    <section class="content-page legal-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 26, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how Degin Studios, owned by Miguel Degin,
        collects, uses and protects information when you use the mobile game <strong>Infini Jumper</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Contact: <a href="mailto:support@deginstudios.com">support@deginstudios.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p>Depending on how you use the game, we may process:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>device information, such as device model, operating system and language,</li>
        <li>advertising identifiers,</li>
        <li>gameplay data, such as progress, coins, gems, rewards and settings,</li>
        <li>purchase-related information for in-app purchases,</li>
        <li>crash reports and technical diagnostics,</li>
        <li>anonymous or pseudonymous player identifiers.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        We do not intentionally collect your real name, postal address or payment card information.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        Infini Jumper uses rewarded ads and interstitial ads. Advertising is provided
        through Unity Ads and LevelPlay. These services may process device information,
        advertising identifiers, approximate location, ad interaction data and technical
        data to deliver, limit, measure and improve ads.
      </p>

      <h2>4. In-app purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Infini Jumper may offer optional in-app purchases, such as virtual gems.
        Payments are processed by Google Play or the Apple App Store. We do not receive
        or store your full payment details.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Database and game progress</h2>
      <p>
        We use Supabase to store game-related data such as player progress, virtual
        currency balances, purchases, rewards and settings. This helps us provide the
        game, restore progress and prevent abuse.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Why we use data</h2>
      <p>We use data to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>operate Infini Jumper,</li>
        <li>save and restore game progress,</li>
        <li>provide rewarded ads and interstitial ads,</li>
        <li>process and restore in-app purchases,</li>
        <li>prevent fraud, cheating and abuse,</li>
        <li>fix bugs and improve the game,</li>
        <li>comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Legal basis for users in the EEA/UK</h2>
      <p>
        Where the GDPR or UK GDPR applies, we process data based on consent, contract
        performance, legitimate interests, and legal obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Infini Jumper may use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Unity Ads / Unity Technologies</li>
        <li>LevelPlay / ironSource</li>
        <li>Supabase</li>
        <li>Google Play Services</li>
        <li>Apple App Store services</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>9. Children</h2>
      <p>
        Infini Jumper is not directed to children under 13. If you are under the age
        required by your country to use apps with advertising or in-app purchases, you
        should only use the game with permission from a parent or legal guardian.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep data only as long as necessary to provide the game, comply with legal
        obligations, resolve disputes, prevent abuse and enforce our terms.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location, you may have the right to access, correct, delete,
        restrict or object to the processing of your personal data. You may also have
        the right to withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.
      </p>

      <p>
        To make a request, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@deginstudios.com">support@deginstudios.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will
        be posted on this page.
      </p>

      <h2>13. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Degin Studios<br />
        Owner: Miguel Degin<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:support@deginstudios.com">support@deginstudios.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
